        "TileImage": "$($repository 4b83cf74-a44e-4923-ac31-a1fccb92342f).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued, and you have been cleared to engage. Michele Inversini owns  small ice cream shop in Sapienza, alongside his nephew, Jack Please. Edmondo Giordano is a friend of the family who was employed at the ice cream shop. 2 weeks earlier, a young lady died from poison, found in her ice cream. The lady was Jack Please&apos;s ex-girlfriend, who, with the help of his bussiness partners, comitted the crime. The family of said lady has contacted us to eliminate the selected targets.",
